   <text type="letter">
      <body>
         <div type="writingSession">
            <pb n="1"/>
            <opener><dateline><date when="1948-12-07">December 7, 1948</date></dateline>
               <salute>Dear <rs ref="#tillich_person_id__2041" type="person">Marie Luise</rs>:</salute>
            </opener>
            <p><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1923" type="person">Hannah</rs> and I would like very
               much to have you here for a few weeks. Since we have a large apartment in Union
               Theological Seminary there is no difficulty about your staying with us. There are
               many friends of ours whom you know and who would like very much to see you also. And
               there is of course a great interest in your colleagues of the psychiatric and
               educational fields about the work and the work of your colleagues in <rs
                  ref="#tillich_place_id__736" type="place">Europe</rs>. We are willing and able to
               give you any financial and other support you would need for your coming and staying
               in this country.</p>
            <closer>
               <salute>Looking forward with great hope to seeing you,<lb/>Yours,</salute>
               <signed><rs ref="#tillich_person_id__1928" type="person"
                  >Prof. Paul Tillich</rs></signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
